  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the shore of Lake Sainte-Croix, in Bauduen, PLAYA Location rents electric boats to explore the lake's turquoise waters and head up towards the Verdon Gorges, with swimming stops along the way.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>It's confirmed on two separate occasions: families have gone out in an electric boat with their dog on board towards the Verdon Gorges, with swimming stops during the outing. A lovely way to discover the lake as a family, dog included. The official website explicitly states that outings can be cancelled depending on weather conditions. The exact cancellation/refund policy shown online is worded somewhat unclearly (timeframes that seem to overlap) — it's best to have it confirmed by phone at the time of booking rather than relying solely on the website.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to book your slot and confirm that your dog can join you on board.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Verdon Gorges and Lake Sainte-Croix offer a spectacular setting for the whole outing.</p>
